sequenceDiagram
  participant CallerApp as 主叫 App
  participant CalleeApp as 被叫 App
  CallerApp->>CalleeApp: 邀请（CALL_KIT_INVITE）
  Note over CallerApp: RECEIVED_BY_CALLEE：显示"正在呼叫"
  Note over CalleeApp: INVITATION_RECEIVED：显示来电
  CalleeApp->>CallerApp: 接听（CALL_KIT_ACCEPT accepted）
  Note over CalleeApp: ACCEPT_SENT_TO_CALLER：显示"接通中"
  Note over CallerApp: ACCEPTED_BY_CALLEE：加入 RTC
  CallerApp->>CalleeApp: 确认（CALL_KIT_ACCEPT ack）
  Note over CalleeApp: ACCEPTED：加入 RTC
